@smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5011
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@refreshToken = REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN
@invitationToken = REPLACE_WITH_INVITATION_TOKEN
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID

### Login (use the seeded super-admin credentials, or any Active account)
# 401 error codes on failure: InvalidCredentials (unknown email or wrong password),
# ProfileIncomplete (invited but hasn't accepted their invitation yet), AccountDeactivated
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

###

### Refresh (rotates the presented refresh token)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout (revokes the presented refresh token)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Accept invitation (from the link emailed via MailHog, http://localhost:8025)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/accept-invitation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{invitationToken}}",
  "newPassword": "SetByInvitedUser123!"
}

###

### Get own profile (any authenticated user)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Create a Backoffice account (Backoffice-only)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/backoffice
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.backoffice@example.com",
  "username": "New Backoffice User"
}

###

### Create a Grid Operator account (Backoffice-only)
POST {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/grid-operators
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.operator@example.com",
  "username": "New Grid Operator"
}

###

### List all users (Backoffice-only)
GET {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Update a user's email/username (Backoffice-only)
PUT {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updated.operator@example.com",
  "username": "Updated Name"
}

###

### Delete a user permanently (Backoffice-only)
DELETE {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Deactivate a user (Backoffice-only; blocked for the seeded super-admin)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Reactivate a user (Backoffice-only)
PATCH {{smart_solar_mgt_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
